From 70710fc786532744cd57e1dd65aa677b03c75c66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Sun, 22 Nov 2026 04:03:46 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] fix(site): match the guide, icons and site tests to the
 shipped app

The release site tests were red on v0.25.0 and main (74 failures, 1
error with zola 0.23.6). Copy the six missing app icons and the license
notice into site/static/icons/. Add the Slot Undercut picture and a
V-Carve section with its picture, and list both kinds in the operation
reference. Add the rotariesBeforeTraverse row to the post-processor
reference. Use the current Tool number label in the guide.

Fix the tests where they were wrong: the icon checks skip one leading
generated catalog block (docs/decisions/3271-site-test-drift.md), the
continuous 4-axis test no longer reads docs/decisions/, the label checks
read the files that draw the labels now, and the MCP guide check names
the AI chat limits that still hold.

Fixes #3271

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
